=== REASONING ===
1. HvacPower: mapped to hvac_power (not in column list). Fix: remap to is_climate_on as boolean proxy.
   enums.ParseHvacPower already returns bool, so it maps cleanly to is_climate_on.
2. DriverSeatBelt: mapped to driver_seat_belt (not in column list). Fix: removed entirely (niche signal).
3. Speed/VehicleSpeed: signalToColumn already had VehicleSpeed->speed_mph (correct).
   LoadLiveState SELECT had old column name 'speed' instead of 'speed_mph'. Fixed.
4. ACChargingPower: was mapping to charger_power (not in list). Fixed to charger_power_kw.
   Combined with DCChargingPower into single special handler (DC priority, AC fallback).
5. PassengerSeatBelt: removed (passenger_seat_belt not in column list).
6. HvacFanSpeed: removed (fan_speed not in column list).
7. All enumBoolSignals: removed (none target valid columns).
8. isVarcharCol: reduced to {defrost_mode} only.
9. isTimestampCol: emptied (no timestamp columns remain in mapped set).
10. LoadLiveState: rewritten to SELECT only valid columns (16 columns down from 60+).

